observations.reproduction_and_cleanup:
Reproduce: from services/workers/, `poetry run python -c "import time; from sayre_workers.parsing.parser import parse_full; from sayre_workers.parsing.models import SourceFile; src=''.join(f'function* g{i}() {{
' for i in range(500)) + 'yield 1;
' + '}
'*500; t=time.time(); parse_full([SourceFile(path='a.js', content=src.encode())]); print(time.time()-t)"` -> ~7s at depth 500, and grows super-linearly with depth (empirically consistent with polynomial, not linear, growth -- not re-derived to an exact exponent here). Cleanup: none required, every probe was in-memory only; the one `git worktree add --detach` fixture used for pre/post-diff isolation was removed via `git worktree remove --force` immediately after use, confirmed via `git worktree list` and `git status --porcelain` showing no leftover path.
